  <item>
    <coll>Gtn</coll>
    <ref>Gtn001.018</ref>
    <rnb>18</rnb>
    <tib>chos thams cad byang chub kyi sems rdzogs pa chen po 'khor ba rtsad nas gcod pa rin po che dang mnyam pa skye ba med pa'i rgyud</tib>
    <skt>sarba d+harmAH mahaA san+d+hi bo d+hi tsit+ta saM sa ra mU la ts+tshe da mahA rat+na sa man+ta a nud pa ton+t+ra</skt>
    <coloph>de nas bcom ldan 'di skad gsungs// e ma rdo rje sems dpa' che// rmad byung bcu gsum skyemedon// 'khor ba rtsad nas gcod pa'i chos// 'di ma shes pa ngal ba'i lam// 'di don rtogs pa'i rnal 'byor dang// gang ltar spyad kyang bde chen klong// rdzogs chen a ti bstan pa 'di// mi nub nub par mi 'gyuro// don la 'gyur ba med pa 'dir// yid bzhin nor bu rgyal mtshan rtse// rmad byung rin chen za ma tog/ don dam skye ba med pa'i rgyud// rigs lnga bde gshegs byang chub sems// rdo rje sems dpa' mchog gi lam// kun bzang thugs kyi bcud btigs pa// sems dpa' rdo rje khyod la gtad// blo yi pad+mo kha phye la// snying gi dkyil du bsgom par gyis// de nas sems dpa'i rdo rje dang// rigs lnga'i sangs rgyas byang chub sems// mgon po tshogs dang bcas pa yis// ma skyes spros bral kun tu bzang// rin chen sgron mas gti mug sel// rmad byung rgyal ba kun gyi yab// rdo rje 'chang chen rigs lnga'i gtso// kun rigs rgyal po thaMd mkhyen// mnyam pa'i rgyal po phyag 'tshal bstod// de bzhin nyid la rtag tu 'dud// ye shes rgyal por mngon par bstod// chos thams cad rin po che dang mnyam pa skye ba med pa'i rgyud// bcom ldan 'das kun rig rgyal pos gsungs pa rdzogso// //rgya gar gyi mkhan po shrI sid+ha dang// bod kyi lo ts+tsha ba bai ro tsa nas bsgyur ba'o</coloph>
